{"reviewId": "16247623_82elE5tsf", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "在2025年的8月初的当下，人口出生率下降的前提下，就业形势严峻的情况下，大都市化最有效的改革方向之一其实是户籍制度的进一步开放。优质人才是吸引，挽留以及培养的。优质人才绝不是通过低端制造业疏解形成的。\n上海、杭州，深圳这一点都做的很好。\n所以现在高考呈现了这样一种趋势，家庭不再唯名牌大学论了。可能首选的是城市，南方的一些城市就非常有吸引力，然后再选院校。深圳的表现仍然和它的过去40多年一样，先锋、抢眼。\n第一个超级大城市很可能不是北京，上海而是深圳。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "27953-27998", "abstract": "住在卫星地区的人口增长了44%。所以，大都市化对我们今天所说的提升内需具有至关重要的作用。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 10, "reviewId": "16247623_82elE5tsf", "userVid": 16247623, "topics": [], "createTime": 1754579108, "userEditTime": 1754579494, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 10, "chapterTitle": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "author": {"userVid": 16247623, "name": "黄建华", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/lpHDr05YrISgc8icw9ZIibpc8aC00b8ib3YxPdBAibmgcXibQ6FZYNuaBqxII53Y4QKfR2m7gZLVWldQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241028-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 14, "likes": [{"userVid": 236582513, "name": "习文", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/KpLic229Uub4YVhVPMBl3UyXC34kEIEAG9npIOExg8vDFat8TVsfgQoVTfViaIGdmL7ZPWABWUBk4Duiaf5ZoibuYg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 5, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "我